# Package F "Deadline": Caitlin hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(deadline), deadline_paid, deadline_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('deadline_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('deadline_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(deadline)') && HasItem('holly_marker')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(deadline)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: My sister Holly owes money to a loan shark called Fargo. He has her marker, and he says she works it off at his club or she disappears. My employer can't know.
#
o_text: I can get the marker.
o_id: deadline_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: deadline_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: He keeps markers in a lockbox in the commerce district, the key on him. Three-fifty. Holly is stupid, but she's mine.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(deadline)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Fargo. Commerce district. Please be quick.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (She tears the marker into very small pieces.) Holly's free.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 350 sat, as agreed.
o_id: deadline_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: deadline_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Three-fifty. (Her calm comes back like a mask.) This conversation did not happen.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'holly_marker', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 350)
effect: SetFlag('deadline_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Holly's working at the club. Fargo says you were reasonable. (She does not finish the sentence.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: Mr. Washington is in a meeting.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: I have a call on line one.
effect: EndConversation
